===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To make a [[breathy]] sound like a whoosh or [[extrude]] with such a sound.
# {{lb|en|ambitransitive}} To pass by quickly and more or less close or [[away]].
## {{lb|en|intransitive|figuratively}} To happen while [[bypass]]ing someone's [[detailed]] [[awareness]], to have someone [[miss the point]].
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To cause to [[pass]] quickly.
#* {{quote-web|en|url=https://twitter.com/RSolisByx/status/1614099774835232773|author=Trocheck Mate @RSolisByx|work=Twitter|date=14-01-2023|passage=Twitter '''whooshed''' your tweet away before I read all of it lmao.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|MLE|slang}} To [[kill]] by [[gun]], to [[shoot]].
#* {{quote-song|en|url=https://genius.com/Moscow17-all-for-the-cause-lyrics|date=2019-09-29|title=All For The Cause|author=Moscow17|passage=Man do it for the team<br/>Kick him and swing him on landing<br/>The olders are '''whooshed'''<br/>Brass and bruck<br/>I promise all of them has been (dun out 'ere)}}
#* {{quote-song|en|title=I Ain’t A Yardie|author=A.M|track=10|album=Mally|date=2020-08-27|url=https://genius.com/Am-i-aint-a-yardie-lyrics|passage=How many man got '''whooshed''' like Jackson?}}
#* {{quote-song|en|date=2022-04-27|author=Tight Road Baby|title=Plugged In|composer=Fumez the Engineer, C Dot|url=https://genius.com/Fumez-the-engineer-and-tight-road-baby-tight-road-baby-x-fumez-the-engineer-plugged-in-lyrics|album=Plugged In: S5 (2022)|track=10|passage=How many man's been '''whooshed''' with the stick?}}

